ffers free tours of its Karachi library. This card covers the tour only: continued library access and borrowing require paid membership.","short_summary":"Book a no-cost look through the Clifton library before deciding whether membership suits you.","source_url":"https://www.britishcouncil.pk/library/join","source_title":"Membership options — British Council Pakistan","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Mohatta Palace Museum","title":"See Mohatta Palace free if you’re under 12","subtitle":"Children younger than 12 receive free museum admission.","notes":"The museum’s official visitor information grants free admission to children under 12. Adults pay admission; the offer is therefore useful only to families visiting with eligible children.","short_summary":"Children under 12 can enter the museum galleries without an admission charge.","source_url":"https://www.mohattapalacemuseum.org/about-the-museum","source_title":"About the Museum — Mohatta Palace Museum","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null},{"entity_name":"Quaid-e-Azam House Museum","title":"Enter free with a student study group","subtitle":"Organized student groups pay no museum admission when visiting for study and research.","notes":"The Government of Sindh’s museum page explicitly exempts student groups entering for study and research. General visitors pay the listed entrance fee, so arrange the group visit through an educational institution.","short_summary":"Students can examine the preserved house as a free group research visit.","source_url":"https://antiquities.sindhculture.gov.pk/tour/quaid-e-azam-house-museum-karachi/","source_title":"Quaid-e-Azam House Museum, Karachi — Directorate General of Antiquities, Government of Sindh","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"place_id":null,"maps_url":null}],"warnings":["Only five activities met the requested evidence standard; the board is therefore incomplete rather than padded to ten.","Most supplied park candidates were excluded because their candidate records establish identity and location only, while accessible official or reliable sources did not explicitly confirm free entry.","The Mohatta Palace and Quaid-e-Azam House activities are eligibility-limited; their cards state the applicable age or student-group requirement.","No supplied candidate exactly matched a selected entity, so all place_id and maps_url fields are null."]}
